{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42787","headline":"寄滑州文秀大师 · 刘兼","name":"寄滑州文秀大师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"分飞屈指十三年，菡萏峰前别社莲。\n薄宦偶然来左蜀，孤云何事在南燕。\n一封瑶简音初达，两处金沙色共圆。\n珍重汤休惠佳句，郡斋吟久不成眠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘兼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42787.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42787","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}